@startuml
' GitHub Actions job DAG from .github/workflows/ci.yaml.
' Colours: teal = fast checks, orange = performance gate, crimson = formal gate,
' blue = cross-platform tests, green = the terminal publish/gate job.
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam ArrowColor #555555
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #333333
  FontColor #10223A
}
skinparam noteBorderColor #7A8797
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #EDEFF2

title CI and Release — job DAG (.github/workflows/ci.yaml)

rectangle "**lint-and-test-types**\nlint (clj-kondo · eastwood · splint · kibit)\n+ test:types + check:demo-deps" as lint #6FB2B0
rectangle "**benchmark**\nbase vs head → compare-benchmarks.js\n--gate-regression 150   (pull_request only)" as bench #E8A33D
rectangle "**formal-verification**\nverify:formal:ci = alignment + Rocq\n(installs Rocq via opam)" as formal #C0504D
rectangle "**test**\nmatrix: OS x browser x {debug, release}\nKarma tests + demo sanity + libs artifact" as test #4F86C6
rectangle "**release**\ndownload libs artifact -> npm publish\n(GitHub Packages)" as release #5FA55A

lint --> bench
lint --> formal
lint --> test

lint --> release
formal --> release
test --> release

note top of bench
  Runs only on pull_request.
  Fails only on a > 150% (2.5x)
  regression; the full report is
  posted to the run summary either way.
end note

note bottom of release
  Runs only on push of a v* tag and
  needs: lint-and-test-types,
  formal-verification, test.
  benchmark is PR-only and is NOT a
  release dependency.
end note

legend right
  |= colour |= job role |
  |<#6FB2B0>   | fast checks (lint + types) |
  |<#E8A33D>   | performance regression gate |
  |<#C0504D>   | formal-methods gate |
  |<#4F86C6>   | cross-platform browser tests |
  |<#5FA55A>   | publish / terminal gate |
endlegend
@enduml
